Faculty of Physics and Astronomy, Adam Mickiewicz University, 61-614 Poznan, Poland
Patrycja Tulewicz, same institute, and Poznan Supercomputing and Networking Center, Institute of Bioorganic Chemistry of the Polish Academy of Sciences, Poznan, Poland
