Contributions (as in Part II)
K.B.: conceptualization, methodology, formal analysis, software, writing (original draft, review and editing), supervision.
P.T., A.M.: the physical model of the device and the interpretation of the results; review and editing.

The comparison section of Part II uses the external package qsdl by F. Grzywa et al.
(https://github.com/Askartan/qsdl), which is not part of this repository.

The git history of this repository records all commits under one account (K.B.) because the code was
assembled and committed from one working copy.

AI assistance: Claude Code (Anthropic) was used to write and run code, to derive and check analytical results, to check numbers against the text, to audit
the results and to draft text, as stated in the papers and in README.md (Use of AI tools). The authors reviewed the code and checked
every number and statement.
